#: woocommerce-onpay.php:825
msgid ""
"When enabled, the browser support probe is skipped and Apple Pay is offered "
"as a payment method in every browser. Requires that the gateway has Apple "
"Pay Web enabled at OnPay and that this shop domain has been registered for "
"Apple Pay Web. If those are not configured, customers in non-Safari browsers "
"will see Apple Pay but will not be able to complete payment."
msgstr ""
"Når indstillingen er aktiveret, springes browsertjekket over, og Apple Pay "
"tilbydes som betalingsmetode i alle browsere. Det kræver, at gatewayen har "
"Apple Pay Web aktiveret hos OnPay, og at shoppens domæne er registreret til "
"Apple Pay Web. Hvis dette ikke er konfigureret, vil kunder i andre browsere "
"end Safari kunne se Apple Pay, men ikke gennemføre betalingen."

